<title>USA: Fed says 3-day fixed system repos total $2.345 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says 3-day fixed system repos total $2.345 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve's three-day fixed system repurchase operation on Monday totaled $2.345 billion, a Fed spokeswoman confirmed.</p>
<p>The Fed added temporary reserves to the banking system via a three-day fixed system repurchase operation earlier this morning.</p>
<p>((Ellen Freilich, N. American Treasury Desk 212-859-1679))</p>
